          "reference": "Persisted settings expose launch-at-login, normalized watched and excluded roots, bounded retention, capacity and growth thresholds, sample interval, pause, and expiring investigation state. The concrete SMAppService adapter is isolated behind a tested backend contract. The lifecycle combines scheduled whole-volume/metadata samples with debounced FSEvents hints, records snapshots and detailed deltas in SQLite, forwards event gaps into explanation confidence, throttles retention work to six-hour intervals, and retains bounded status history. Injected failure then success reproducibly produces accessible Degraded then Recovered states. Notifications fire only on threshold crossings. The existing popover now presents state, detail, growth, pause/resume, capacity, and export; the settings menu opens the complete control surface. Visual evidence: /Users/merdankiji/Documents/Codex/2026-09-12/as-x20/work/pyramid-disk-steward/TASK-212-ui-smoke/rendered-status-board.png"
